; Route the @harness scope to the Harness Artifact Registry's `ait-commons`
; hosted npm bucket, which is where @harness/ai-test-sdk is published.
; Everything else (Playwright, axios, ...) resolves through the default
; registry.npmjs.org. The bucket is public-read so `npm install` requires
; no auth token.
@harness:registry=https://harness0.harness.io/pkg/l7B_kbSEQD2wjrM7PShm5w/ait-commons/npm/
